.SH "NAME"
probe::netdev.rx \- Called when the device is going to receive a packet
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
.nf
probe netdev\&.rx {}
.fi
.SH "VALUES"
.PP
\fIdev_name\fR
.RS 4
The device received the packet
.RE
.PP
\fIprotocol\fR
.RS 4
The packet protocol
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO\n 
.IR tapset::networking (3stap)
